{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"alwaysEvent"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSync\/Kind-swift.enum\/alwaysEvent","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlsync\/kind-swift.enum\/alwaysevent"]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Case","symbolKind":"case","role":"symbol","title":"MXLSync.Kind.alwaysEvent","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"alwaysEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL7MXLSyncV4KindO11alwaysEventyA2EmF"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The strictest synchronization, not forgiving of missing performed events."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSync","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSync\/Kind-swift.enum"]]},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLSync/Kind-swift.enum":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Kind"}],"role":"symbol","title":"MXLSync.Kind","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The sync-type type specifies the style that a score following application should use to synchronize an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"accompaniment with a performer. The none type indicates no synchronization to the performer. The tempo type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"indicates synchronization based on the performer tempo rather than individual events in the score. The event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"type indicates synchronization by following the performance of individual events in the score rather than"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the performer tempo. The mostly-tempo and mostly-event types combine these two approaches, with mostly-tempo"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"giving more weight to tempo and mostly-event giving more weight to performed events. The always-event type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provides the strictest synchronization by not being forgiving of missing performed events."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlsync\/kind-swift.enum","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Kind","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSync\/Kind-swift.enum"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLSync/Kind-swift.enum/alwaysEvent":{"role":"symbol","title":"MXLSync.Kind.alwaysEvent","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The strictest synchronization, not forgiving of missing performed events."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlsync\/kind-swift.enum\/alwaysevent","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"alwaysEvent"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSync\/Kind-swift.enum\/alwaysEvent"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}],"title":"IvorMXL","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLSync":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSync","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLSync","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLSync","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlsync","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The sync type specifies the style that a score following application should use to synchronize an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"accompaniment with a performer. If this type is not included in a score, default synchronization depends on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the application."}],"title":"MXLSync"}}}